{"game": "repo", "language": "english", "appid": 3241660, "month": "2026-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1768521600, "end_date": 1769212799, "month_true_total": 5229, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-10-05 12:53:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "216646029", "author": {"steamid": "76561198966691904", "personaname": "Flowery", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheCheeseGuy/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 3104, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 671, "last_played": 1786416072, "avatar": "2088c346268a1d9fc3cc1a4121136b8659f404cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10, The big head man is very nice! He can vomit up high value items!", "timestamp_created": 1769211629, "timestamp_updated": 1769211629, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216645725", "author": {"steamid": "76561199569210269", "personaname": "Razordash", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199569210269/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 21887, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5191, "last_played": 1789595720, "avatar": "d9fca5cb1e664c32b6cefe9cf569246e1e983170"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall Score: B+\n\nDespite my concerns for hearing that this was horror game (which I'm not a fan of), Repo is actually a fun game in trying to collect as much valuables to sell as best you can while progressing levels. This game is much better to play with friends, for while you can play solo, it is considerably less fun in my opinion. I've never played with strangers in this game, but I can see a few problems with trolling or arguments over who gets what power ups so take care when you play with strangers. On the other hand if you're blessed with close friends this game can test your ability to cooperate in seeing how far your teamwork can go. We've had numerous times where everything seems to be going smoothly along until someone yells and everyone is in a panic trying to figure out what happened, and it's either a monster attack or someone accidently pushed the cart into the pit. (The latter being me...) Equally funny some of the nicknames I heard given to the monsters because we didn't know their names at the time.\n   However, despite the massive fun we've had, there are also some points of concern. One thing I didn't like about this game is how the monsters in the later levels seem to appear almost all at once and would just cause absolute chaos with 5 or 6 monsters running around at once. Or in some cases, having 3 Bella's in one of the early levels which constantly stalled our ability to collect values. Also, some levels like the Headmans manor, while nice looking, In later levels is filled with so much tight hallways and twist and turns that it's one of our least favorite levels to play.\n   Despite the occasional frustration with being able to do nothing but run or hide, this game was overall a very positive experience for me and is best played with your friends or family. I can't recommend playing it solo however. I hope you found this review helpful.", "timestamp_created": 1769211306, "timestamp_updated": 1769211361, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216645624", "author": {"steamid": "76561199876543916", "personaname": "thecoolestguyxxx1754", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.